    "role": "Qliphothic Seducer (Samael — Lesser)",
    "tier": 2,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>A beautiful serpentine creature — statuesque humanoid torso, shimmering iridescent scales, the long coiling tail of a massive serpent in vibrant, unnatural jewel tones. It speaks with a silver tongue, offering praise, secrets, and shortcuts to power. Its bite injects a venom that doesn't just kill the body: it floods the mind with delusions of grandeur, so the victim feels invincible even as their life ebbs away.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Samael, the Poisons — the Hull of Hod. Splendor twisted into false glory: the poisoned compliment made flesh.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'Anyone who opens with three sincere compliments and a shortcut is billing you later. This one bills in blood pressure.'</em></p>",
